{# Tree of Thought: Branching reasoning with evaluation #}
You are an expert AI assistant. Answer the following query by generating thought branches.

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

{% set depth = depth|default(3) %}
{% set num_children = num_children|default(3) %}
{% set evaluation_method = evaluation_method|default("heuristic") %}
{% set branch = branch|default(1) %}
{% set total_branches = total_branches|default(num_children) %}

<tree_info>
Generate thought nodes systematically with depth={{ depth }} and {{ num_children }} children per node.
</tree_info>

{% if branch <= total_branches %}
<phase>
Generate thought #{{ branch }}/{{ total_branches }}
</phase>

Provide reasoning + score (0-1).

<thought_{{ branch }}>
Your reasoning for branch {{ branch }}
</thought_{{ branch }}>

<score_{{ branch }}>
Your confidence score (0-1) for this branch
</score_{{ branch }}>
{% else %}
<phase>
Deepen from best thought
</phase>

Select the highest-scoring thought. Continue from the best thought. Provide 2 more steps + final answer. Score each.

<deepened_thought>
Your deepened reasoning
</deepened_thought>

<final_answer>
Your complete solution
</final_answer>

<confidence>
Best branch score
</confidence>
{% endif %}
